{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following equations have the same graph?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b7bd6a3275647f22ff7e2108a76b9743a48e3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I.\\quad y=x-2 \\qquad II.\\quad y=\\frac{x^2-4}{x+2}\\qquad III.\\quad (x+2)y=x^2-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"489\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/81705369de2b55acfc380dba1dd340130ac3a825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) I and II only} \\quad \\text{(B) I and III only} \\quad \\text{(C) II and III only} \\quad \\text{(D) I,II,and III} \\quad \\\\ \\text{(E) None. All of the equations have different graphs}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"549\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equations differ at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f226eebf91a88812cbbed46cd0a97e67530a7494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would contain the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/7/6971e63c9606ed5755be38e5faa83a93b24703fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2, -4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> is undefined in the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/3/af3906651d16a548230a504127bc5b308a64068f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$II$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> because it gives a denominator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; and the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40a16dd7d1d1fedb353096f50c74ce0da7d1d093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$III$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> contains the whole the vertical line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f361efa9ea92a34219e05e0825907161f273f17a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> as for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> value, the equation still satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf5d5d68b588a00d5c97d06c5739ba0c381243e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe7f23eabd94b3e41778e97abfa56e88079789c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${E}$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems